WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.102
-In the span of
just a few hours,

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.270
President Trump caved

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.172
on the signature promise
of his campaign

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.907
and one of his closest advisers

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.709
was indicted in
the Russia investigation.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:11.644
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.780
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.282
♪♪

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.984
It's not often
that a single event

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:20.052
sums up an entire presidency,
but on Friday,

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:21.554
we got one
that came pretty close.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:24.123
Remember, Trump brags that he
only hires the best people,

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:25.858
calls the Russia investigation
a hoax,

00:00:25.858 --> 00:00:27.259
calls CNN fake news,

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:30.230
and his government shutdown
left FBI agents without pay.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.830
So it was especially ironic

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:34.366
when one of Trump's
closest associates was arrested

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:36.970
by unpaid FBI agents working
for the special counsel

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.304
in the Russia investigation,

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:40.572
and the whole thing
was caught on tape by CNN.

00:00:40.572 --> 00:00:41.874
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:44.444
The only way --

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:47.413
The only way that could have
been more humiliating for Trump

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:50.015
is if Robert Mueller celebrated
by eating a Happy Meal

00:00:50.015 --> 00:00:52.217
at McDonald's, on a date
with Stormy Daniels.

00:00:52.217 --> 00:00:54.854
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:57.389
And you know, when Trump first
heard about the arrest,

00:00:57.389 --> 00:00:59.091
he was furious to find out

00:00:59.091 --> 00:01:01.860
that the FBI
hadn't also been shut down.

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.663
[ As Trump ] What?
I thought there were no laws

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.999
during the shutdown, like
in that movie "The Purge."

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:07.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:09.602
When do I get my purge?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.037
[ Normal voice ] When, in fact,

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:13.239
the FBI was affected
by the shutdown.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:15.474
But that didn't stop them
from making the arrest.

00:01:15.474 --> 00:01:18.377
-These FBI agents making
this arrest of Roger Stone

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:21.514
in Fort Lauderdale this morning,
like every other FBI agent,

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:24.150
they're not being paid
right now.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:27.754
800,000 federal workers begin
missing their second paycheck

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.488
this week.
-Wow.

00:01:29.488 --> 00:01:32.591
Imagine being such an ass[Bleep]
that FBI agents

00:01:32.591 --> 00:01:35.427
will come into work
and arrest you for free.

00:01:35.427 --> 00:01:38.631
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:41.901
"If you think I'm coming in --

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.836
Oh, Roger Stone?
Yeah, on my way.

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:45.304
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:48.173
Somehow, the day managed to get
even more humiliating for Trump,

00:01:48.173 --> 00:01:51.077
because just a few hours later,
Trump was forced to cave

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:52.911
on the signature promise
of his campaign

00:01:52.911 --> 00:01:54.146
and reopen the government

00:01:54.146 --> 00:01:55.414
without money
for his border wall.

00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:57.516
After 35 days of subjecting
millions of people

00:01:57.516 --> 00:01:59.552
to needless suffering and pain,
Trump gave up.

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.754
And he did it
in true Trump fashion

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:04.490
by rambling aimlessly
about walls.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.358
-Walls work. They do work.

00:02:06.358 --> 00:02:09.996
No matter where you go,
they work.

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:12.732
We have barriers at the border

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:16.702
where natural structures
are as good

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:18.637
as anything that we can build.

00:02:18.637 --> 00:02:20.105
They're already there.

00:02:20.105 --> 00:02:22.342
They've been there
for millions of years.

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.910
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.813
Last year alone,
ICE officers removed

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:30.483
10,000 known or "suspested"
gang members,

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:35.588
like MS-13 and
members as bad as them.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:41.961
Horrible people.
Tough, mean, sadistic.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:45.898
Think of that.
we apprehended 60,000 people.

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:48.668
That's like a stadium
full of people.

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.436
A big stadium.

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:53.339
-Man, even right after suffering
a humiliating defeat,

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:56.209
he still talks like the guy
in front of me in line

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:57.977
at the pharmacy.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:02:59.812
"Wow, a whole stadium, huh?
Cool.

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:01.748
Hey, um, they're calling you.
They have your pills."

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:03.382
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.382 --> 00:03:04.717
And because
the speech made no sense,

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:06.252
Trump later had to follow up
on Twitter

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:07.720
and insist that
even though he caved

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.021
without getting
anything he wanted,

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:12.291
he had actually won.
-The president wrote, "I wish

00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:15.794
people would read or listen
to my words on the border wall.

00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:17.897
This was
in no way a concession."

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:20.999
-Yeah, we did listen.
You said "suspested."

00:03:20.999 --> 00:03:23.402
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:23.402 --> 00:03:25.904
We were listening.

00:03:25.904 --> 00:03:30.576
Also, if you have to tell people
it wasn't a concession,

00:03:30.576 --> 00:03:32.345
then it was
definitely a concession,

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:34.847
like that time Custer wrote home
from Little Bighorn,

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:36.949
"This was in no way
my last stand."

00:03:36.949 --> 00:03:38.217
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.217 --> 00:03:40.186
Trump caved after 35 days,
got nothing.

00:03:40.186 --> 00:03:42.088
You got to give credit
to the air traffic controllers,

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:43.556
flight attendants,
TSA screeners,

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:46.191
and custom agents who showed
the power of labor solidarity.

00:03:46.191 --> 00:03:48.494
And you got to give credit
to House Speaker Nancy Pelosi,

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.930
who held out long enough
and kept her caucus together.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.566
Meanwhile, Republicans spent the
last few days of the shutdown

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:55.001
at each other's throat.

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:57.937
-Frustration is growing among
Republicans on Capitol Hill,

00:03:57.937 --> 00:04:00.539
and we quote,
"Republican Senators clashed

00:04:00.539 --> 00:04:03.108
with one another and confronted
Vice President Pence

00:04:03.108 --> 00:04:05.712
inside a private luncheon
on Thursday

00:04:05.712 --> 00:04:07.346
as anger hit a boiling point

00:04:07.346 --> 00:04:09.549
over the longest government
shutdown in history."

00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:11.950
'This is your fault,'
Senator Ron Johnson told

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.786
Majority Leader Mitch McConnell
at one point,

00:04:13.786 --> 00:04:16.322
according to two Republicans
who attended the lunch

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:17.690
and witnessed the exchange.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.892
'Are you suggesting
I'm enjoying this?'

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:21.394
McConnell snapped back."

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:24.797
-First of all, Mitch McConnell
doesn't enjoy anything.

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.832
[ Laughter ]
I think, at the very most,

00:04:26.832 --> 00:04:28.700
he has a rudimentary
nervous system

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.103
that allows him
to respond to light and heat.

00:04:31.103 --> 00:04:33.373
[ Laughter ]
Enjoyment is beyond him.

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:36.342
Here he is in a bouncy house.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.477
Here's Mitch McConnell
doing a cannonball.

00:04:38.477 --> 00:04:41.247
[ Laughter ]
Second, it's all of your fault.

00:04:41.247 --> 00:04:43.081
You could have ended
the shutdown at any time,

00:04:43.081 --> 00:04:45.251
but you subjected millions of
people to needless misery

00:04:45.251 --> 00:04:48.020
for a President who lied
and a wall that won't work.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:51.023
In other words, you're all...
-Horrible people.

00:04:51.023 --> 00:04:53.492
-So the shutdown gave us
more evidence

00:04:53.492 --> 00:04:55.962
that Trump is not the master
deal-maker he claimed to be.

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:57.530
And the indictment of Stone,

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.198
who has been one of
his closest associates,

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:01.300
gave us more evidence
that he does not, in fact,

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:02.468
hire the best people.

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:04.337
Now, if you're not familiar
with Roger Stone,

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:06.672
he's the third one.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:06.672 --> 00:05:10.643
He's also a longtime
political dirty trickster,

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:13.312
known for his shady tactics
and his bizarre outfits.

00:05:13.312 --> 00:05:16.149
This is his actual outfit
from the inauguration,

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:18.150
and by far the best thing
about his arrest is

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.818
we can make fun of
this picture again.

00:05:19.818 --> 00:05:21.421
I mean, look at that.

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.489
Did Quentin Tarantino
remake "Lincoln"?

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:24.657
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:27.059
I didn't know "Downton Abbey"
had a pimp.

00:05:27.059 --> 00:05:29.362
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:31.530
If he weren't
a political consultant,

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:35.101
he'd be the world's oldest
chimney sweep.

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:38.304
He looks like he got kicked out
of the Magic Castle for vaping.

00:05:38.304 --> 00:05:42.141
[ Laughter ]
Mueller arrested him

00:05:42.141 --> 00:05:44.243
on seven counts of perjury
and five counts

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:46.512
of looking like
Teddy Roosevelt's deadbeat dad.

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:49.948
By the way, that isn't even the
only insane outfit he's worn.

00:05:49.948 --> 00:05:52.351
Look at all these.
These look like headshots

00:05:52.351 --> 00:05:53.786
from the poster of
a one-man show

00:05:53.786 --> 00:05:55.822
called, "My Mother is Italian,
My Father is Jewish,

00:05:55.822 --> 00:05:58.824
and I'm in Jail."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:58.824 --> 00:06:00.225
Stone got his start in politics

00:06:00.225 --> 00:06:02.562
working for both Richard Nixon's
presidential campaigns,

00:06:02.562 --> 00:06:03.963
and he loves Nixon so much,

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:06.899
he famously has Nixon's face
tattooed on his back.

00:06:06.899 --> 00:06:09.001
Although it's equally possible
that the tattoo

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:11.637
just burned itself into his skin
while he was sleeping.

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:14.507
"You have the mark!"

00:06:14.507 --> 00:06:17.276
And after Stone left
the courthouse on Friday,

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:18.777
he celebrated his political hero

00:06:18.777 --> 00:06:21.247
by doing the Nixon victory pose
for the cameras.

00:06:21.247 --> 00:06:22.715
Now, you might be thinking
to yourself,

00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:24.483
"Didn't Nixon resign
in disgrace?

00:06:24.483 --> 00:06:27.386
Maybe that's not the best pose
to show you're innocent."

00:06:27.386 --> 00:06:29.355
[ Laughter and applause ]
But Stone doesn't remember that,

00:06:29.355 --> 00:06:30.956
because he spent most
of the '70s

00:06:30.956 --> 00:06:32.525
traveling the world
in a glass elevator

00:06:32.525 --> 00:06:35.994
he stole from Willy Wonka.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:35.994 --> 00:06:40.266
And if I were Stone,
I'd be afraid of the parallels,

00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:42.468
because Nixon's presidency
ended, in part, over charges

00:06:42.468 --> 00:06:43.669
that he obstructed justice,

00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:45.004
and the indictment
against Stone alleges

00:06:45.004 --> 00:06:46.372
that he was very intent

00:06:46.372 --> 00:06:48.107
on interfering
in Mueller's investigation.

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:49.642
For example,
Stone sent an e-mail

00:06:49.642 --> 00:06:52.077
to a guy named Randy Credico,
a radio host

00:06:52.077 --> 00:06:54.213
who allegedly acted
as an intermediary

00:06:54.213 --> 00:06:56.115
with WikiLeaks founder Julian
Assange.

00:06:56.115 --> 00:06:58.818
And in that e-mail, Stone
tried to get Credico to lie

00:06:58.818 --> 00:07:01.086
by citing a character
from "The Godfather"

00:07:01.086 --> 00:07:03.256
as an example to follow.
-The special counsel

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:05.925
also indicted Stone
for witness tampering.

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:09.996
This for allegedly attempting to
sway radio host Randy Credico,

00:07:09.996 --> 00:07:12.431
allegedly a go-between
with Assange,

00:07:12.431 --> 00:07:15.000
before Credico testified
to Congress.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.169
The indictment alleges
that Stone said Credico

00:07:17.169 --> 00:07:19.705
"should do a Frank Pentangeli,"

00:07:19.705 --> 00:07:22.675
referring to a character
in "The Godfather: Part II"

00:07:22.675 --> 00:07:25.210
who lied to Congress.
-That's right.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.113
Stone literally told the witness
to do a Frank Pentangeli,

00:07:28.113 --> 00:07:30.315
a character in "The Godfather"
who lies to Congress.

00:07:30.315 --> 00:07:32.951
This guy was basically begging
to be arrested.

00:07:32.951 --> 00:07:34.620
I mean, he imitates
Richard Nixon,

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:35.888
he quotes from "The Godfather,"

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:37.757
and he dresses likes
Hannibal Lecter.

00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:39.025
[ Laughter ]

00:07:39.025 --> 00:07:40.692
But Stone's e-mail to Credico
got weirder.

00:07:40.692 --> 00:07:42.528
Stone allegedly
threatened Credico

00:07:42.528 --> 00:07:44.964
in an attempt to keep him quiet
during the investigation.

00:07:44.964 --> 00:07:46.766
And at one point,
according to the indictment,

00:07:46.766 --> 00:07:51.070
Stone even suggested he would
steal Credico's therapy dog.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.305
According to an e-mail
included in the indictment,

00:07:53.305 --> 00:07:56.442
Stone also said he would
"take that dog away from you."

00:07:56.442 --> 00:07:57.910
Man, it really doesn't
help your case

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:00.947
when you make the same threats
as the Wicked Witch of the West.

00:08:00.947 --> 00:08:02.981
[ Laughter ]

00:08:02.981 --> 00:08:05.351
He actually threatened
to steal the guy's dog.

00:08:05.351 --> 00:08:07.186
How much more of a villain
can you be?

00:08:07.186 --> 00:08:08.754
"I'll steal that dog of yours,

00:08:08.754 --> 00:08:12.158
and then it's off to Monte Carlo
in my autogyro!"

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:15.194
[ Laughter ]

00:08:18.096 --> 00:08:19.765
That's it.

00:08:19.765 --> 00:08:21.467
That was the last one
about his outfit.

00:08:21.467 --> 00:08:24.536
Yet even after threatening
another guy's dog,

00:08:24.536 --> 00:08:26.072
Stone had the audacity
to complain

00:08:26.072 --> 00:08:27.473
about the FBI's treatment of him

00:08:27.473 --> 00:08:29.208
in a courthouse press conference
on Friday.

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:32.377
-This morning,
at the crack of dawn,

00:08:32.377 --> 00:08:36.515
29 FBI agents arrived
at my home,

00:08:36.515 --> 00:08:40.285
with 17 vehicles
with their lights flashing,

00:08:40.285 --> 00:08:44.056
when they could simply have
contacted my attorneys.

00:08:44.056 --> 00:08:45.657
And I would have been
more than willing

00:08:45.657 --> 00:08:48.160
to surrender voluntarily.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:52.397
They terrorized my wife,
my dogs.

00:08:52.397 --> 00:08:54.467
-Oh, now
you're worried about dogs?

00:08:54.467 --> 00:08:55.868
[ Laughter ]

00:08:55.868 --> 00:08:57.402
Well, I hate to break it to you,
buddy,

00:08:57.402 --> 00:08:58.971
but when they heard you
threaten one of them,

00:08:58.971 --> 00:09:02.741
they flipped on you.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.741 --> 00:09:05.878
It's clear.
[ Applause ]

00:09:05.878 --> 00:09:09.081
[ Barking ]

00:09:09.081 --> 00:09:11.349
[ Laughter ]
It's clear what's going on here.

00:09:11.349 --> 00:09:13.619
Stone is obviously angling
for a pardon from Trump,

00:09:13.619 --> 00:09:14.920
who has shown a willingness

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:16.889
to praise witnesses
who refuse to cooperate

00:09:16.889 --> 00:09:18.290
and attack those who do.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.526
And to get that pardon,
Stone has been going on TV,

00:09:20.526 --> 00:09:22.294
complaining about the FBI
and the media

00:09:22.294 --> 00:09:23.595
to win Trump's favor,

00:09:23.595 --> 00:09:25.865
like in this interview
he did on "Fox News Friday."

00:09:25.865 --> 00:09:30.069
-It's disconcerting that CNN was
aware that I would be arrested

00:09:30.069 --> 00:09:32.838
before my lawyers were informed.

00:09:32.838 --> 00:09:35.107
That's disturbing.

00:09:35.107 --> 00:09:37.242
If it was a dangerous situation

00:09:37.242 --> 00:09:39.010
which would merit
the SWAT team,

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:42.114
well, then CNN's cameraman
would be in danger.

00:09:42.114 --> 00:09:45.651
I'm not a flight risk.
In fact, I think my passport

00:09:45.651 --> 00:09:48.320
has expired or
it will expire in a few days.

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:49.788
-That's silly.

00:09:49.788 --> 00:09:52.558
You don't need a passport
to travel via magic umbrella.

00:09:52.558 --> 00:09:54.660
[ Laughter ]

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:57.596
I lied. That was the last one.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:57.596 --> 00:10:00.132
One after another, the
President's closest associates

00:10:00.132 --> 00:10:01.500
are being indicted
or going to jail.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.802
Trump says he only
hires the best,

00:10:02.802 --> 00:10:04.604
but Stone's indictment
is more proof

00:10:04.604 --> 00:10:06.605
that Trump surrounds
himself with...

00:10:06.605 --> 00:10:09.041
-Horrible people.
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:09.041 --> 00:10:12.078
[ Cheers and applause ]

